' Preload the structural C4-PlantUML stack from the local vendored bundle.
' RELATIVE_INCLUDE must point at this folder.
'
' C4_Sequence is left out: it redefines element and relationship macros for
' sequence diagrams, and render.sh switches to C4_All_Sequence_Last.puml when it
' detects sequence markers.
'
' C4_Dynamic is left out too: it replaces Rel with a version that numbers every
' relationship, which is wrong in context, container and component diagrams. A
' dynamic diagram adds `!include_once RELATIVE_INCLUDE/C4_Dynamic.puml` itself.
'
' Each file includes its parent with a plain !include, so keep this order:
' parents before children. Newer PlantUML versions (1.2026.10) reject an
' !include_once of a file that an earlier plain !include already pulled in.
!include_once RELATIVE_INCLUDE/C4_Context.puml
!include_once RELATIVE_INCLUDE/C4_Container.puml
!include_once RELATIVE_INCLUDE/C4_Component.puml
!include_once RELATIVE_INCLUDE/C4_Deployment.puml
